# The V2 structural search was screened and not carried, so this directory
# keeps only the evidence that settles the record: the equivalence proof, the
# predictive-SD rejection, the frozen candidate it applies to, and the
# screening and temporal artifacts that record why each dial is off. The
# drivers that produced them, the search-space modules they import and the
# duplicated screening passes are not on this branch; they remain on
# research/nba-game-latent-state-shadow-v2-structural.
factor_loadings.parquet
